# JWT Authentication API Testing
# Sử dụng với VS Code REST Client extension hoặc IntelliJ HTTP Client

### 1. Test Public Endpoint (không cần authentication)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/public
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Đăng ký user mới
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Đăng nhập để lấy tokens
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Test Protected Endpoint (cần access token)
# Thay YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN bằng accessToken từ response login
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/protected
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 5. Test User Endpoint (cần USER_READ permission)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/user
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 6. Test Admin Endpoint (cần ADMIN role)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/admin
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 7. Refresh Access Token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### 8. Logout (revoke refresh tokens)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 9. Test với token đã logout (should fail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/protected
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN